+# Git attributes
+# https://git-scm.com/docs/gitattributes
+
+# Auto-detect text files and normalize line endings to LF
+* text=auto eol=lf
+
+# Force LF for shell scripts (avoid CRLF issues on Windows)
+*.sh        text eol=lf
+*.bash      text eol=lf
+
+# Rust source
+*.rs        text diff=rust
+
+# Markdown
+*.md        text eol=lf
+*.markdown  text eol=lf
+
+# YAML / JSON / TOML (text config)
+*.yml       text eol=lf
+*.yaml      text eol=lf
+*.json      text eol=lf
+*.toml      text eol=lf
+*.cfg       text eol=lf
+*.ini       text eol=lf
+
+# Lockfiles are not diffable, generate them rather than merge
+Cargo.lock  linguist-generated=true merge=bundle
+package-lock.json   linguist-generated=true merge=bundle
+yarn.lock            linguist-generated=true merge=bundle
+pnpm-lock.yaml       linguist-generated=true merge=bundle
+composer.lock        linguist-generated=true merge=bundle
+Gemfile.lock         linguist-generated=true merge=bundle
+poetry.lock          linguist-generated=true merge=bundle
+Pipfile.lock         linguist-generated=true merge=bundle
+
+# Vendored / generated / large
+vendor/**     -text diff
+target/**      -text linguist-generated
+node_modules/** -text linguist-generated
+dist/**        -text linguist-generated
+build/**       -text linguist-generated
+
+# Binary
+*.png   binary
+*.jpg   binary
+*.jpeg  binary
+*.gif   binary
+*.ico   binary
+*.pdf   binary
+*.zip   binary
+*.gz    binary
+*.tgz   binary
+*.tar   binary
+*.wasm  binary
+
+# Linguist overrides for accurate GitHub language stats
+docs/*              linguist-documentation
+.github/            linguist-documentation
+*.md                linguist-documentation
+
+# rustfmt/clippy markers
+/.rustfmt.toml      export-subst
